# Smatchet first-party C/C++ — LLVM base, 4-space indent, left-aligned pointers/references.
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 120
PointerAlignment: Left
ReferenceAlignment: Pointer
SortIncludes: Never
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
NamespaceIndentation: None
